[A] Which of the following is invalid variable name and why?

 BASICSALARY, _basic, basic-hra, #MEAN

 group., 422, population in 2006, over time

 mindovermatter, SINGLE, hELLO, queue.

 Plot # 3, 2015_DDay, teams'svictory 


The following are invalid variable names:

basic-hra – Uses - (hyphen), which is not allowed.
#MEAN – Uses #, which is not allowed.
group. – Uses . (dot), which is not allowed.
422 – Starts with a digit.
population in 2006 – Contains spaces.
over time – Contains spaces.
queue. – Uses . (dot).
Plot # 3 – Contains spaces and #.
2015_DDay – Starts with a digit.
teams'svictory – Contains an apostrophe ('), which is not allowed.